page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"CEMC Pascal\">CEMC Pascal</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 203/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2460/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 310/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5090/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.824      1 -total\n 45.56%    7.210      1 Template:CEMC_box\n 33.44%    5.291      1 Template:Image_n